{"baseRefName":"main","body":"Fixes https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/980\n\n## What failed\n\nThe seven default-branch runs named in the issue were downloaded and matched to their timestamps and SHAs. Six workflows passed. CI/CD run 31186108359 exposed three actionable defects:\n\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check` rejected an unformatted assertion in `tests/unit/total_closure.rs`.\n- the local Rust/WASM unknown-opener spec allowed live search, so its Chinese case received ranked web results instead of exercising the local fallback;\n- the permission cold-start spec returned after the click appended the user message, before the worker captured the pending task. A retry hid this race.\n\n## Fix\n\n- format the rejected Rust statement;\n- make the opener parity spec hermetic with a browser-level cross-origin request boundary;\n- wait for a worker answer and the observable `data-has-pending-task=true` state instead of an incidental message count;\n- add issue-specific regression gates, requirements traceability, and a changelog fragment.\n\nThe complete issue/PR/comment/run evidence, timeline, root-cause analysis, validation logs, Hive Mind guide, and full Rust/JS/Python template snapshots are preserved in [`dev/log/issues/980/pulls/981`](https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/tree/issue-980-7930e3c647c0/dev/log/issues/980/pulls/981). The audit found no new template-owned defect: the applicable template controls were already adopted in PRs 809 and 971, and PR 971 already filed the remaining upstream gaps, so this PR avoids duplicate reports.\n\n## Reproduction and verification\n\n- regression gates were run before the fixes and failed on the formatting/isolation invariants;\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`;\n- `cargo clippy --lib --bins --tests --all-features -- -D warnings`;\n- `cargo check --examples --all-features`;\n- `cargo test --all-features` — full suite green (2,597 unit tests plus integration/standalone suites; three intentionally ignored tests);\n- `rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs`;\n- `rust-script scripts/check-hardcoded-language.rs`;\n- `bash scripts/check-secrets.sh`;\n- `npm --prefix tests/e2e run check:web-tdz`;\n- `npm --prefix tests/e2e run check:web-hardcoded-ui`;\n- opener parity: 12/12 across three repetitions;\n- permission cold start: 9/9 across three repetitions.\n","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOSbOoU88AAAABN6bf2A","author":{"login":"konard"},"authorAssociation":"MEMBER","body":"<!-- hive-mind:working-session-summary -->\n## Working session summary\n\nImplemented and pushed the issue #980 fixes to PR 981:\n\n- Fixed the deterministic Rust formatting failure.\n- Isolated WASM opener tests from live search providers.\n- Fixed the permission cold-start race by waiting for actual pending-task state.\n- Added regression tests, requirements traceability, and changelog entry.\n- Collected 578 evidence files—including all referenced CI logs, issue/PR data, template snapshots, timeline, and root-cause analysis—under `dev/log/issues/980/pulls/981/`.\n- Full Rust suite passed: 2,597 unit tests plus integration suites.\n- Formatting, strict Clippy, examples, secret scan, file-size, language, and repeated Playwright tests passed.\n\nPR: https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/981\n\nFresh CI is running on the latest evidence-only commit, so the PR remains draft until those checks complete.\n\n---\n*This summary was automatically extracted from the AI working session output.*","createdAt":"2026-08-08T23:11:54Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/981#issuecomment-5228650456","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOSbOoU88AAAABN6blAA","author":{"login":"konard"},"authorAssociation":"MEMBER","body":"## 🤖 Solution Draft Log\nThis log file contains the complete execution trace of the AI solution draft process.\n\n### 💰 **Cost estimation:**\n- Model: GPT-5.6 Sol\n- Provider: OpenAI\n- Public pricing estimate: $29.682304\n\n### 📊 **Context and tokens usage:**\n- 679.6K / 200K (340%) input tokens, 33.8K / 128K (26%) output tokens\n\nTotal: (679.6K + 21.4M cached) input tokens, 33.8K output tokens, $29.682304 cost\n\n### 🤖 **Models used:**\n- Tool: OpenAI Codex\n- Requested: `gpt-5.6-sol`\n- Thinking level: off (disabled)\n- **Model: GPT 5.6 Sol** (`gpt-5.6-sol`)\n\n### 📎 **Log file uploaded as Gist** (7048KB)\n- [View complete solution draft log](https://gist.githubusercontent.com/konard/f0e00bd23399d171bc86b4cd1330f935/raw/20bf1adf4599393b74d04010d8a890a7c9996479/tmp-hive-mind-log-upload-cMStbu-sanitized.log.txt)\n\n---\n*Now working session is ended, feel free to review and add any feedback on the solution draft.*","createdAt":"2026-08-08T23:12:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/981#issuecomment-5228651776","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOSbOoU88AAAABN6kUxw","author":{"login":"konard"},"authorAssociation":"MEMBER","body":"## 🎉 Auto-merged\n\nThis pull request has been automatically merged by hive-mind.\n- All CI checks have passed\n\n---\n*Auto-merged by hive-mind with --auto-merge flag*","createdAt":"2026-08-08T23:40:36Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/981#issuecomment-5228795079","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-08-08T22:11:30Z","authors":[{"email":"drakonard@gmail.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","login":"konard","name":"konard"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-08T22:11:30Z","messageBody":"Adding .gitkeep for PR creation (default mode).\nThis file will be removed when the task is complete.\n\nIssue: https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/980","messageHeadline":"Initial commit with task details","oid":"3a730a5b3e435750fa7f8a3956ac1cb3fa2703ca"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-08T23:09:38Z","auth